pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
- elementId: top-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: badge-bg
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 12, 120, 20]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: badge-text
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 12, 120, 20]
  content:
    fontSize: 12
    color: #FFFFFF
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.0
    align: [center, middle]
    wrap: False
    text: |
      CH08
- elementId: exp-title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 40, 300, 35]
  content:
    fontSize: 24
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      <p><strong>实验结果</strong></p>
- elementId: exp-body
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 80, 1160, 230]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      <p>OSDI 论文报告可支持大量 enclave 和较大安全内存。具体指标需核对原文 Table/Figure 后写入。</p>
- elementId: eval-title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 330, 300, 35]
  content:
    fontSize: 24
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    text: |
      <p><strong>文章评价</strong></p>
- elementId: eval-table
  elementType: table
  bounds: [60, 370, 1160, 280]
  columnWidths: [0.2000, 0.8000]
  rowHeights: [0.2000, 0.2000, 0.2000, 0.2000, 0.2000]
  style: $default
  rows:
    -
      - content: {text: "维度"}
      - content: {text: "判断"}
    -
      - content: {text: "设计优势"}
      - content: {text: "系统贡献强，直接解决 PMP-based enclave 在规模上的瓶颈。"}
    -
      - content: {text: "主要局限"}
      - content: {text: "需要硬件修改和生态配套，不等同于 RISC-V ratified confidential-computing standard。"}
    -
      - content: {text: "商业落地"}
      - content: {text: "适合云原生 enclave 服务方向；风险在硬件采纳、标准化和云平台管理接口。"}
    -
      - content: {text: "讲稿定位"}
      - content: {text: "代表性改进；证据强度 E1"}
- elementId: source
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
  content:
    fontSize: 14
    color: $secondary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.2
    text: |
      来源：Penglai: scalable enclave memory protection｜证据等级：E1 / Peer-reviewed SOTA
- elementId: bottom-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
